# Local cross-agent memory (continuity notes for this checkout). This repo
# is public on GitHub; internal working notes don't belong in its history,
# so this stays local-only (and can still sync privately machine-to-machine
# outside of git, e.g. Resilio) rather than being committed/pushed.
memory/

# Same reasoning: private operational/personal notes (e.g. Gmail cleanup
# session detail) that must never land in this public repo's history.
docs/reports/private/
